WebCore pieces that assume extra threads: IndexedDB serialization, file streams,
image decoding and dedicated workers run on the engine thread's loop; the few
synchronous cross-thread waits a single thread cannot satisfy fail cleanly
(module workers, synchronous loads and sockets in workers, crypto key wrapping).

